摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Guide Dog for DSH — MiniMax multimodal plugin: image/video/music/speech generation & vision tools, voice mode, voice input. Real-time call mode implemented: streaming voice conversation, unified floating UI, adaptive prompts, zh/en i18n. Accessibility features planned for testing","id":"gh:1334213602","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-guide-dog","slug":"AtropinolTT/dsh-guide-dog","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin","minimax","multimodal","tts","voice-input"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Guide Dog for DSH — MiniMax multimodal plugin: image/video/music/speech generation & vision tools, v"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"oice mode, voice input. Real-time call mode implemented: streaming voice conversation, unified float"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ing UI, adaptive prompts, zh/en i18n. Accessibility features planned for testing"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Guide Dog for DSH, powered by MiniMax"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A dynamic Cordis plugin that gives DeepSeek Harness multimodal superpowers through\nthe mmx CLI (Mini"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"amic Cordis plugin that gives DeepSeek Harness multimodal superpowers through\nthe mmx CLI (MiniMax):"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Eyes for DeepSeek** — MiniMax VLM (`guide_dog_vision` / `guide_dog_inspect`)\ndescribes images, s"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"o a model with no native vision input (e.g. DeepSeek) can\nstill review frontend designs, figures, sc"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"reenshots, and generated images.\n- **Hands for generation** — images (`image-01`), video (`MiniMax-H"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"3` / Hailuo),\nspeech (MiniMax TTS), music (`music-3.0`), text (`MiniMax-M3`), and web search.\n- **We"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"b UI preview & playback** — every generated file is served same-origin at\n`/guide-dog/media/<file>` "},{"id":"p5s6","text":"and rendered inline in the conversation tool cards\n(`<img>`, `<audio controls>`, `<video controls>`)"},{"id":"p5s7","text":", plus a **Guide Dog**\nsettings page with auth status and a speak tester.\n- **Skill integration** — "},{"id":"p5s8","text":"`guide_dog_speak` reuses your existing\n`audio-conversation` and\n`speech-mmx` skill pipelines\n(text t"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"ransform, CJK auto-detect, per-language voices, host playback),\nand falls back to raw `mmx speech sy"},{"id":"p5s10","text":"nthesize` when the skill scripts are absent.\n- **Automatic invocation** — a mounted system-prompt se"},{"id":"p5s11","text":"ction\n(`guide-dog-vision`, order 110) tells the agent to auto-invoke the inspection\ntools for any jo"},{"id":"p5s12","text":"b needing visual checks, especially when the active model\ncannot see images.\n- **Call mode (Phase 2,"},{"id":"p5s13","text":" shipped)** — hands-free, real-time voice conversation\nin the web UI: VAD / push-to-talk turn-taking"},{"id":"p5s14","text":", streaming sentence-level TTS\nwith barge-in, consensus-first protection for write commands, progres"},{"id":"p5s15","text":"s\nannouncements, and a unified floating dual-pill UI at the composer with\nzh/en i18n (details in \"Ph"},{"id":"p5s16","text":"ase 2 — call mode\" below).\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Featured"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Guide Dog is featured in dsh-recommend,\na community-curated plugin directory for DSH. It passed the "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"project's\ncertification review and carries the gold **certified** badge at the top of\nthis README; t"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"he score badge updates automatically on every registry sync."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Feature list"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Voice mode (host event-driven)** — a host `session/event` listener watches\n`assistant/message` e"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"vents, extracts the reply text\n(`event.data.content` blocks with `type === 'text'`), checks whether "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"voice\nmode is effective for that session (session override else global default),\nand enqueues the TT"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"S result (`{url, key}`) or error into a per-session\n`voiceQueue`. The client polls the queue every s"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"econd and plays it with a\nmodule-level `Audio` object, or shows a bottom-right toast + beep for 6s.\n"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"- **Voice cluster** — `conversation.input.left` entry `guide-dog-voice`\n(order 30) at the input box'"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"s bottom-left, themed with DSH tokens\n(`--dsw-alias-*`), inheriting the app font:\n- small **speaker*"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"* icon — click toggles the per-session voice-mode override\n(`guide-dog/set-config` with `voiceMode.s"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"essions`); hover tooltip shows\n\"Voice mode: on/off · Global default: on/off\".\n- **language dropdown*"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"* — recognition language detection (auto/zh/en).\n- **mic** icon — record → transcribe → insert (feat"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"her-style SVG; recording\nstate pulses red with a second counter).\n- **Session-scoped playback** — pl"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"ayback runs on a module-level `Audio`\nobject, so switching sessions never replays or interrupts it: "},{"id":"p9s13","text":"the current\nclip plays to the end unless a new playback task (a fresh queue entry from\nany session) "},{"id":"p9s14","text":"overrides it.\n- **Mic voice input** — the mic in the cluster: MediaRecorder with 1s\ntimeslices, live"},{"id":"p9s15","text":" second counter, maxSeconds auto-stop, language from the\ndropdown, and transcribe via `guide-dog/tra"},{"id":"p9s16","text":"nscribe`. Recognized text is\ninserted into the input box with `inputActions.setDraft(text)` (auto-se"},{"id":"p9s17","text":"nd\nvia `inputActions.submit()` when configured). Error states: `mic_denied`,\n`no_device`, `empty_spe"},{"id":"p9s18","text":"ech`, `stt_failed`, `stt_timeout`,\n`engine_unavailable`, `insert_failed` (never silent).\n- **Recorde"},{"id":"p9s19","text":"r page** — sandboxed clients that cannot record in-page get a\n`🎙 Open recorder page` link to the sta"},{"id":"p9s20","text":"ndalone `/guide-dog/recorder` page\n(GET serves a self-contained HTML recorder; POST\n`/guide-dog/tran"},{"id":"p9s21","text":"scribe-upload` accepts raw `audio/webm`, 20 MB cap, and runs\nthe same `transcribeImpl`).\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Feature list"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **WebSocket-free dual channel** — uplink is a whole-clip POST\n`/guide-dog/call-transcribe` (webm/o"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"pus, ≤20MB, reuses the Phase 1\n`transcribeImpl` and the local whisper pipeline) → `{ok, text, langua"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ge,\ndurationMs}`; downlink is `GET /guide-dog/tts-stream` over a chunked HTTP\nstream (the host spawn"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"s `mmx speech synthesize --stream --format pcm\n--sample-rate 24000` per sentence and pipes stdout in"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"crementally into\n`res.write`; the client reads the stream with `fetch().body.getReader()`\n→ PCM→WAV "},{"id":"p11s6","text":"→ seamless Web Audio scheduling). No new WebSocket protocol\nsurface on the transport layer; browser "},{"id":"p11s7","text":"and CLI reuse the same pipeline.\n- **Automatic VAD + push-to-talk (PTT)** — default VAD (`call.mode="},{"id":"p11s8","text":"'vad'`):\nMediaRecorder (`audio/webm;codecs=opus`, 250ms timeslice, continuous\nrecording) + a paralle"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"l AnalyserNode energy detector (RMS ≥\n`vad.threshold`; silence for `vad.silenceMs` ends an utterance"},{"id":"p11s10","text":";\n`vad.minSpeechMs` minimum speech; `vad.maxSegmentSeconds` per-segment cap)\n— speak-pause-speak aut"},{"id":"p11s11","text":"omatically becomes two turns; the panel can switch\nto `ptt` push-to-talk (hold the mic to talk, rele"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"ase to send; VAD\nparameters do not participate in endpointing, only in interruption\nmonitoring).\n- *"},{"id":"p11s13","text":"*Consensus-first (core interaction paradigm)** — active only when\ncall/a11y is on; typing mode keeps"},{"id":"p11s14","text":" the Phase 1 behavior: a prompt soft\nconstraint (`guide_dog_call_consensus` systemPrompt variable, c"},{"id":"p11s15","text":"onversational\nwording: understand intent first, ask when unclear, explain before\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Security notes"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- Media dir inside the workspace root → no sandbox widening required.\n- The route serves only plugin"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"-owned media with allowlisted extensions.\n- The MiniMax API key stays in mmx's own config (`~/.mmx/c"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"onfig.json`); the\nplugin never reads or forwards it.\n- Host playback uses the raw `subprocess` servi"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"ce (players must outlive the\nsandbox's `--die-with-parent` bwrap profile); each new playback termina"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"tes the\nprevious one."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
